  "description": "An id_lineage table between the OSHB WLC 4.20 token ids of Genesis 1:1-2 (as in hebrew-cantillation-genesis-1) and a hypothetical next revision made for this fixture: the prefixed words בְּרֵאשִׁ֖ית and הַשָּׁמַ֖יִם are segmented into two morphemes each (split, suffixes a and b), the two maqqef pairs עַל־פְּנֵי in verse 2 are merged into one token each (merge), the last word of verse 2 is deleted and a new token inserted (delete, insert), and every other id is kept (same). Ids are never renumbered. The cases map sets of old ids and the invalid tables must be rejected with the named error kind.",
